spice
* Components
M1 5 10 0 0 NMOS
M2 2 8 0 0 PMOS
M3 2 9 0 0 PMOS

V1 10 0 DC V1
V2 8 0 DC V2
VDD 3 0 DC VDD
VREF 7 0 DC VREF
VSS 0 0 DC VSS

RD1 3 5 RD
RD2 3 6 RD

IBIAS 9 7 DC IBIAS

* Net Definitions
* 0: Ground
* 2: Drain of Q2/Q3 
* 3: VDD
* 5: Drain of Q1
* 6: Source of Q2
* 7: Non-inverting terminal of IBias
* 8: Connects V2
* 9: Connects IBias and Q3 Gate/Source
* 10: Connects V1 and Q1 Gate

.END